  "title": "\"what are people's thoughts on Oceans 11\"",
  "summary": "At 04:38Z on Sat 14 Nov @norvid-studies.bsky.social asked \"what are people's thoughts on Oceans 11\". Five minutes later a small account in the cluster, @kitto.nekoweb.org, answered \"Which one\". He replied, in quotation marks, \"there are more than one?\", and was told \"Rat pack 1960 vs Lexington & Shawnee 2001\"; asked about the new one, the answer was \"It's good, I like it\". @brennan.computer said it is perhaps his favourite film and that he watches it every year on the flight to Vegas. Another branch, with @nainrouge420.bsky.social, moved from praise of the film to a request for more things like it, in the asker's own phrase (\"Legitimately what else is like this, I want to build a collection\"). The thread has 15 posts in the data from 6 accounts; the digest notes one reply removed under the consent rules.",
